Spec: Active ride

Purpose:
  The live ride screen: map with route and position, live stats, pause and stop, and the ride dialogs.

Owns:
  ./*.dart
  ./widgets/*.dart
  /test/active_ride

References:
  /docs/specs/history/12-active-ride.md
  /docs/specs/history/17-follow-route.md
  /docs/specs/history/18-follow-reverse.md
  /lib/tracking/tracking.sdd

Must:
  The ride starts once per screen session.
  An external stop (notification, Live Activity, swipe-away) returns home.
  Back while recording asks to discard first.
  The stats panel shows speed, distance, duration and top speed with Pause or Resume and Stop.
  Stop asks first, then the summary offers title (at most `60` characters), comment, favourite, Save, Skip
    and Discard; the ride is already stored at stop.
  Save writes the details and renders the preview; Skip keeps the ride as is; Discard deletes it.
  An offline banner shows while offline.
  With a followed route the map shows it, a to-go line and off-route or distance-to-route banners sit in
    the map area, and the stats panel keeps its height.
  Without a followed route the screen is unchanged.
